{"id":"7a71d4dcf31c11e4","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-forwardchainingcorrect.md","title":"Forward chaining computes the semantic pure Horn closure","display":"thm-forwardchainingcorrect — Forward chaining computes the semantic pure Horn closure","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-forwardchainingcorrect","aliases":["27-thm-forwardchainingcorrect"],"display":"thm-forwardchainingcorrect — Forward chaining computes the semantic pure Horn closure","depends_on":["[[27-df-forwardchaining]]","[[27-df-hornclosure]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§6.4.2 Lemmas 6.2–6.3 and Remark 6.2","source_statement":"Forward chaining computes the semantic pure Horn closure","source_printed_pages":"285","source_pdf_pages":"309","verification_status":"proved-in-note-source-statement-and-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-forwardchainingcorrect"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-forwardchainingcorrect</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-forwardchainingcorrect — Forward chaining computes the semantic pure Horn closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7a057444873ebdd2\" href=\"?note=7a057444873ebdd2\" title=\"27-df-forwardchaining\">27-df-forwardchaining</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"866e5085ffe52570\" href=\"?note=866e5085ffe52570\" title=\"27-df-hornclosure\">27-df-hornclosure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§6.4.2 Lemmas 6.2–6.3 and Remark 6.2"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7a71d4dcf31c11e4\" href=\"?note=7a71d4dcf31c11e4\" title=\"Forward chaining computes the semantic pure Horn closure\">Forward chaining computes the semantic pure Horn closure</a>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"285"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"309"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note-source-statement-and-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathrm{PureHornDNF}_n\">\\(D\\in\\mathrm{PureHornDNF}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\">\\(h=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq[n]\">\\(S\\subseteq[n]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FC}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{FC}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7a057444873ebdd2\" href=\"?note=7a057444873ebdd2\" title=\"27-df-forwardchaining\">27-df-forwardchaining</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HornCl}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{HornCl}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"866e5085ffe52570\" href=\"?note=866e5085ffe52570\" title=\"27-df-hornclosure\">27-df-hornclosure</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FC}_n(D,S)=\\mathrm{HornCl}_n(h,S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FC}_n(D,S)=\\mathrm{HornCl}_n(h,S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每轮新增头都在任何含 S 的假点支持中；最终集合对全部规则封闭，其特征向量本身是假点，所以等于所有这类支持的交。同步过程至多 n 轮即稳定，不依赖选取规则的顺序。此节点把既有语义闭包连接到显式有限算法，而项测试已由既有 hornclosureimp 给出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-forwardchaining","status":"resolved","id":"7a057444873ebdd2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-forwardchaining]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-hornclosure","status":"resolved","id":"866e5085ffe52570","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-hornclosure]]","embed":false},{"target":"Forward chaining computes the semantic pure Horn closure","status":"resolved","id":"7a71d4dcf31c11e4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · source_statement","heading":"","excerpt":"[[Forward chaining computes the semantic pure Horn closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-forwardchaining","status":"resolved","id":"7a057444873ebdd2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D\\in\\mathrm{PureHornDNF}_n$，$h=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)$，$S\\subseteq[n]$；$\\mathrm{FC}_n$ 见 [[27-df-forwardchaining]]，$\\mathrm{HornCl}_n$ 见 [[27-df-hornclosure]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-hornclosure","status":"resolved","id":"866e5085ffe52570","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D\\in\\mathrm{PureHornDNF}_n$，$h=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)$，$S\\subseteq[n]$；$\\mathrm{FC}_n$ 见 [[27-df-forwardchaining]]，$\\mathrm{HornCl}_n$ 见 [[27-df-hornclosure]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"D\\in\\mathrm{PureHornDNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"h=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FC}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HornCl}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FC}_n(D,S)=\\mathrm{HornCl}_n(h,S).","display":true}],"bytes":1529,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-57","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-forwardchainingcorrect|thm-forwardchainingcorrect — Forward chaining computes the semantic pure Horn closure]]"}],"outgoing":["7a057444873ebdd2","866e5085ffe52570"]}